# Drums the tracker plays itself, from the drum-singles sample set -- no
# window to open. Pads as Samples > Edit Sample Set shows them:
# E-4 Kick 32, C-5 Snare 17, C#4 Hat 45, C-4 Clap 08, F-5/E-5 Toms 12/06.
# Four tracks on the one set, so a kick, a snare, a hat and a clap can share
# a row -- a track plays one note at a time.
tracker 1
bpm 100
lpb 4
track 1 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 1 name Kick
track 1 samples drum-singles
track 2 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 2 name Snare
track 2 samples drum-singles
track 3 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 3 name Hats
track 3 samples drum-singles
track 4 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 4 name Clap
track 4 samples drum-singles
track 5 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 5 name Track 5
track 6 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 6 name Track 6
track 7 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 7 name Track 7
track 8 channel 1 velocity 100 mute 0
track 8 name Track 8
order 0 0 0 1
pattern 0 rows 16
cell 0 0 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 0 0 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 0 2 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 0 4 2 C-5 .. .. ..
cell 0 4 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 0 6 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 0 8 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 0 8 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 0 10 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 0 10 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 0 12 2 C-5 .. .. ..
cell 0 12 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 0 14 3 C#4 2A .. ..
pattern 1 rows 16
cell 1 0 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 1 0 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 1 2 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 1 4 2 C-5 .. .. ..
cell 1 4 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 1 6 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 1 8 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 1 8 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 1 10 1 E-4 .. .. ..
cell 1 10 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 1 12 2 C-5 50 .. ..
cell 1 12 3 C#4 50 .. ..
cell 1 12 4 C-4 .. .. ..
cell 1 13 2 C-5 3C .. ..
cell 1 14 2 F-5 .. .. ..
cell 1 14 3 C#4 2A .. ..
cell 1 15 2 E-5 .. .. ..
